{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GMNNormalizer","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"GMNNormalizer","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/init()"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change"],"title":"Enumerations","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"text":"A type that normalizes a Guido Music Notation score to canonical form.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Processing","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNFormatter"],"anchor":"Processing"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Normalization-is-what-makes-a-score-fully-typed","text":"Normalization is what makes a score fully typed","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser"},{"type":"text","text":" promotes only the tags that bind cleanly as written. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"normalizer performs the repairs that let the rest promote, then re-runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"promotion on the result:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a tag-name alias is collapsed to its canonical long form;"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a deprecated parameter name is renamed to its current one;"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":" reference in tag-parameter position is substituted by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declared value;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a parameter of the wrong type is dropped, since such a value is inert —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\staccato<0.5>"},{"type":"text","text":" means the same as a bare "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\staccato"},{"type":"text","text":";"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"so is one written to a tag that keeps none, one written on an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tag, and a raw (unquoted) identifier, none of which anything reads;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"a unit written on a parameter that cannot carry one is dropped, keeping","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the magnitude.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each of those is something Guido provably never reads, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"licenses the repair: the score’s meaning is unchanged and the loss is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announced rather than silent. The one thing no repair touches is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"text":" reference no declaration answers, which has to survive to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each is reported as a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Re-running promotion is safe because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promotion is a total, idempotent function of a tag’s name and parameters,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the two untyped lanes as its fallback: a tag that still does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bind is carried through exactly as written.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The visible consequence is that ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a parsed score is less typed than a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"normalized one"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". A consumer that switches over ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","type":"reference"},{"text":" should read a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"score whose ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore\/isNormalized","type":"reference"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"What-it-does-not-do","type":"heading","text":"What it does not do"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Normalization never fails. Three defects survive every repair above — a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"required parameter still missing, an unnamed parameter past the end of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tag’s template, and a value the tag’s own class cannot read — and each is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carried through to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which reports it as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Judging is the validator’s job; this stage only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"repairs, so a caller that wants a diagnosis calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on what it gets back."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tag carrying one of those three stays on an untyped lane, which is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gives the validator something to read. Otherwise the only untyped tags left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after normalization are the ones that belong there: "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose name GMN does not reserve at all, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is down to the three reserved names no typed payload claims —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrRenz"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnnormalizer"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/UsingIvorGMN":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN","kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Take Guido Music Notation text from ","type":"text"},{"code":"Data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a validated syntax tree, and back","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/usingivorgmn","type":"topic","title":"Using IvorGMN"},"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/GMNNormalizer":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GMNNormalizer","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GMNNormalizer","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that normalizes a Guido Music Notation score to canonical form."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNNormalizer","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnnormalizer","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/GMNTag/custom(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmntag\/custom(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"custom"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNCustomTagV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GMNCustomTag"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A tag GMN does not reserve, carried as written.","type":"text"}],"title":"GMNTag.custom(_:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag